d cousin, was over, she got together with her best friend Hart and the two are about to get married. That is, if Sven doesn't ruin things."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"In der Fortsetzung der gleichnamigen Serie, steht Lolle nun endlich vor der Entscheidung, mit wem sie ihre Zukunft verbringen möchte: Sven oder Hart. Doch wieder einmal scheint alles schwieriger als gedacht, nicht nur weil die Hochzeit mit Hart im letzten Moment von Sven torpediert wird, sondern auch weil sie, wegen der Flucht von der Hochzeit, nun Sozialstunden ableisten muss, die weitreichende Folgen für ihre Firma, ihr Liebesleben und ihre gesamte Zukunft haben wird."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A0O42ttbwzd8BHAEzHsbIXHuPj0.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":632587,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hy7dbF4YXX5fMbxisAbQpwwknwa.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gHWummM59EXitBSvat0j2TxGS73.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gHWummM59EXitBSvat0j2TxGS73.jpg","language":"de","width":763,"height":1080},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pDC1m5DgMZioD27EKA43KhBihRW.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pDC1m5DgMZioD27EKA43KhBihRW.jpg","language":"de","widt